<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 21.1pt; TEXT-INDENT: -21.1pt; mso-char-indent-count: -2.0"><FONT size=3><B><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: red; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt"><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes">   </SPAN></SPAN></B><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt"><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes"> </SPAN></SPAN></FONT><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt"><FONT size=3>收作业时间：<SPAN lang=EN-US>7:35--7:45</SPAN></FONT><FONT size=3>，来不及也可以在早上第</FONT><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT size=3>1</FONT></SPAN><FONT size=3>节课后收，个别任课教师有要求，也可以在昨天晚自修下课后收取，通校生一到校就在早自修结束后补交。</FONT></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt"><FONT size=3>（<SPAN lang=EN-US>1</SPAN></FONT><FONT size=3>）</FONT></SPAN><FONT size=3><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt">学生早上到班早，但学习欠自觉的班级，要求班主任早一点到校组织学生学习。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt"><FONT size=3>（<SPAN lang=EN-US>2</SPAN></FONT><FONT size=3>）</FONT></SPAN><FONT size=3><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt">学生早上到班早，学习自觉但人数较少的班级，要求班主任做好扩面工作。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt"><FONT size=3>（<SPAN lang=EN-US>3</SPAN></FONT><FONT size=3>）</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt"><FONT size=3>住校生务必于<SPAN lang=EN-US>6</SPAN></FONT><FONT size=3>：</FONT><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT size=3>45</FONT></SPAN><FONT size=3>到班早学早读，请班主任落实班干部做好点名工作，住校学生未能按要求到班早读早学的，班主任要加强教育，做到“准时到班、到班即静，落座即学”。</FONT></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 21pt; TEXT-INDENT: -21pt; mso-char-indent-count: -2.0"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt"><FONT size=3>（<SPAN lang=EN-US>4</SPAN></FONT><FONT size=3>）</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt"><FONT size=3>语、英教师轮到早上下班指导的，要在前一天布置好具体的早学早读内容，并准时（提倡提前）下班指导学生早学早读；<SPAN lang=EN-US>7:15</SPAN></FONT><FONT size=3>前学生可早读选考科目读背内容。</FONT></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 21pt; TEXT-INDENT: -21pt; mso-char-indent-count: -2.0"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt"><FONT size=3>（<SPAN lang=EN-US>5</SPAN></FONT><FONT size=3>）</FONT></SPAN><FONT size=3><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt">要求班主任每周对自己班级住校生早学早读情况进行抽查。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><FONT size=3><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt">学校继续加强对全校各班早读早学情况进行专项检查，并不断细化检查内容，及时通过校园网反馈检查的详细情况。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
